the wings upon its back, as the figure turns towards you, and approaches. Your final glimpse is of a malicious grin and then - darkness.\nYou have been assigned the task 'Clipping An Ascended's Wings'.\nAn embittered presence's thoughts fill your mind with distant and vague images: a figure, clouded and blurred, as though the presence has willed for centuries that this moment had never existed. For a split second, you catch a clearer glimpse of the figure kneeling by a pool; as it rises, you realize it was a myriad of delicate wings...\n\n---\n\nKill 10 ascended or enraptured ser alsa thel 0/10 (Sepulcher of Order)\n_These mobs are found in the north-central part of the zone (in the area outside the Triumvirate's tomb room)._\n_Upon the last kill:_\nA feeling of tranquility encompasses you, freeing you from a resentment which has lasted for centuries.\n_Reward:_\nExperience (about 1.2 AAs at Level 95)\n150 platinum",
