ot let him be buried alone!\nYou have been assigned the task 'Rest In Pieces'.\nThe memories of an embittered presence fill your mind with bittersweet memories of a dear friend, always so kind and trusting. In your mind's eye, you can still see him on that fateful day, reassuring you that everything will be all right, as they sealed him inside his final coffin.\n\n---\n\nKill 4 shrouds or revenants of thelasa 0/4 (Sepulcher of Order)\nKill 5 deceased or departed thelasas 0/5 (Sepulcher of Order)\n_These mobs are found along the walls of the zone-in area and in the middle sections of the zone._\n_Upon the last kill:_\nA feeling of tranquility encompasses you, freeing you from a resentment which has lasted for centuries.\n_Reward:_\nExperience\n150 platinum",
