is no [justice].\nYou say, 'Drowning?'\nAn embittered presence's memories cease their whirling, and freeze like ice within your mind, as you reach your resolution: you will not be caught!\nYou have been assigned the task 'Sleeping With The Fishes'.\nThe memories of an embittered presence fill your mind with the rush and thunder of the river's rapids. Your pursuers close in; there nowhere to hide! You plunge into the river and are dragged under by the current. As you lose your consciousness, you see scavenger fish beginning to school around you, exposing your location.\n\n---\n\nKill 4 eels 0/4 (Sepulcher of Order)\nKill 3 tideshells 0/3 (Sepulcher of Order)\n_These mobs are found in the western area of the zone (outside the lower of the two middle entrances to Sepulcher West)._\n_Upon the last kill:_\nA feeling of tranquility encompasses you, freeing you from a resentment which has lasted for centuries.\n_Reward:_\nExperience (about 1 AA at Level 95)\n150 platinum",
