      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Sepulcher of Order [zone=815]\n**Who:**\n- An embittered presence [npc=39331]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Alaran Language:** | 88\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a brooding selyrah [npc=39471]\n- a nesting goral [npc=39501]\n- a ravenous raptor [npc=39508]\n- a savage raptor [npc=39512]\n- a starving raptor [npc=39520]\n- a territorial goral [npc=39529]\n- a vicious raptor [npc=39540]\n- an alsa thel selyrah [npc=39552]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Dec 13 21:53:49 2011\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a kill task that begins with an embittered presence at the zone-in of the Sepulcher of Order (location -185, -50, 4 -- the entrance area from the City of Bronze)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- No tasks\n\\- 88 Skill Level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, An embittered presence'\nAn embittered presence fills your mind, flooding your consciousness with shattered but vivid memories of a past that was not your own; an existence filled with such anger and resentment that although life no longer remains, the [hatred] lives on as its own entity. It pulses within your mind, trying to consume you.\nYou say, 'Hatred?'\nAn embittered presence's memories whirl like a cyclone: kindness turned to [betrayal]; a friend, [buried] alive; running, being [hunted] like an animal; a waterfall; falling - [drowning]!; a hand, dragging you from the depths; and finally a single, glowing green flame, leaving you cold and numb as your fate is decided. There is no [justice].\nYou say, 'Hunted?'\nAn embittered presence's memories cease their whirling, and freeze like ice within your mind, as you reach your resolution: you will not be hunted!\nYou have been assigned the task 'It's A Jungle Out There'.\nThe memories of an embittered presence fill your mind with trees and the rustling of leaves. You remember being chased through a forest; hunted, like an animal. Wild beasts rise to attack you, slowing your progress and aiding your pursuers. Now they will know your vengeance!\n\n---\n\nKill 2 gorals 0/2 (Sepulcher of Order)\nKill 2 selyrah 0/2 (Sepulcher of Order)\nKill 4 raptors 0/4 (Sepulcher of Order)\n_These mobs are found in the eastern part of the zone (the lower of the two middle entrances to Sepulcher East)._\n_Upon the last kill, you see:_\nA feeling of tranquility encompasses you, freeing you from a resentment which has lasted for centuries.\n_Reward:_\nExperience (about 1 AA at Level 95)\n150 platinum",
